-- Imports `defs`, which JL4_LIBRARY_PATH finds at the top of the project (top/),
-- one folder above this file: the service looks there for a bare name, after
-- the folder of the importing file. No prelude import: with JL4_LIBRARY_PATH
-- set, the built-in standard library is skipped.
IMPORT defs

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
`double it` MEANS n * 2
